&lt;li&gt;Build and execute strategic account plans that connect users’ business priorities with relevant Stripe products and capabilities&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Develop trusted relationships with executive, commercial, product, and technical stakeholders&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Lead customer discovery, product discussions, business-case development, commercial negotiations, and deal strategy&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Partner closely with core Account Executives to align on account strategy, executive relationships, opportunity ownership, and sequencing&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Help users expand into new business units, geographies, products, and embedded-finance use cases&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Coordinate cross-functional teams through solution design, pricing, contracting, implementation, activation, and growth&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Become an internal and customer-facing expert on Stripe Issuing and Treasury, relevant use cases, integration models, and the competitive landscape&lt;/li&gt;
