&lt;li&gt;Demonstrated ability to build collaborative relationships and influence cross-functional teams without direct authority.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience developing business cases and leading complex commercial negotiations.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A self-starting, highly organized approach and the ability to deliver results in an ambiguous, fast-moving environment.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Excellent written, verbal, presentation, and analytical skills.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Willingness to travel approximately 10% of the time for user meetings, team events, sales kickoffs, and occasional international business needs.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Preferred qualifications&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
