&lt;li&gt;Knowledge of payment preferences and commerce trends in one or more major APAC markets.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience working in a product-sales overlay model alongside account executives, customer success teams, or technical sellers.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Familiarity with product-led integrations and complex customer organizational or account structures.&lt;/li&gt;
