&lt;li&gt;Supporting account expansion by identifying opportunities, driving business outcomes, and ensuring customers achieve success, working closely with the account team;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Cultivating relationships with senior executives in various departments, such as business, product, engineering, finance, and IT, in partnership with the Account Executive and team;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Evangelizing Stripe&#39;s customer success stories, as well as its systems and processes;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Articulating and driving customer use cases, value, and expansion while maintaining a trusted advisor status;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Serving as a knowledgeable payments and commerce advisor, educating customers on the benefits of our products and industry.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Who you are&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Minimum requirements&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Requires 8 years of experience in a client-facing role, managing relationships with large, global organizations.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Position also requires the following:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;8 years of experience executing customer facing activities to drive value and ROI from Billing and payments technical products;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;8 years of experience collaborating with internal teams to create optimization plans that align with ROI opportunities, providing in depth analysis and suggestions for the user;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;8 years of experience monitoring and managing client’s technical experience and engagement experience, proactively monitoring performance metrics and sentiment;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;8 years of experience working with account teams to identify, track and mitigate clients at risk of churning from the platform;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;4 years of experience billing technical and functional landscape, with a demonstrated understanding of customer needs and how these map to relevant functionality and use cases; and&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;4 years of experience advising clients on their subscription and invoicing requirements.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Salary: $208,021 - $225,300/yr&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This salary range represents the base salary range for the role and any sales commissions / sales bonuses targets, if applicable, would be in addition to the base salary.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;40 hrs/week&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;50% telecommuting permitted.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;15% domestic travel for visiting users for onsite and business reviews at their offices.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Multiple Positions Available.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Additional benefits for this role may include: equity, company bonus or sales commissions/bonuses; 401(k) plan; medical, dental, and vision benefits; and wellness stipends.&lt;strong&gt; &lt;/strong&gt;&lt;strong&gt;IL48&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
