&lt;li&gt;Ability to work across multiple stakeholder groups and escalate issues to leadership when appropriate.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;An enthusiastic, hands-on mentality and willingness to contribute as an individual contributor while leading a team.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong analytical skills and a structured approach to solving complex business problems.&lt;/li&gt;
