&lt;li&gt;Establish high standards for reliability, security, engineering craft, and operational rigor across the systems the team owns&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Improve the experience of mobile engineers and AI agents by using measures of developer productivity, build and test performance, and release health to guide investments&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Work effectively with geographically distributed colleagues to maintain alignment, visibility, and clear ownership across teams&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
