&lt;h3&gt;About the team&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;The Technical Account Management (TAM) team partners directly with our largest and fastest-growing users. We support them proactively through a consultative model and reactively to resolve their most complex issues, helping them grow their businesses.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We partner closely with Sales to attach the right support plans to the right users at the right time. We take a user-first approach, capturing feedback on what we need to offer to delight users and exceed expectations. We operate with a scaled, proactive, and preventive mindset to help ensure users have a smooth experience with Stripe.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;What you’ll do&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Stripe is looking for an experienced leader to lead and grow the TAM team responsible for supporting our largest and most strategic users. You will lead a high-performing team of experienced TAMs and manage managers who are motivated by improving the lives of Stripe’s users.&lt;/p&gt;
