&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Who we are&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About Stripe&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Stripe is a financial infrastructure platform for businesses. Millions of companies, from the world’s largest enterprises to the most ambitious AI startups, use Stripe to accept payments, grow their revenue, and create new business opportunities. Our mission is to increase the GDP of the internet, and we have a significant amount of work ahead. That means you’ll have an unprecedented opportunity to put the global economy within everyone’s reach while doing the most important work of your career.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What you’ll do&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;India is producing a new generation of ambitious, AI-native companies built for global markets, while global businesses increasingly look to India for growth. As the Sales Leader, India, you will shape Stripe’s role in this transformation, helping businesses expand across the India-US corridor and beyond. This is a rare opportunity to build a category-defining sales organization at the intersection of AI, global commerce, and India’s digital economy.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;As the Sales Leader, India, you will own Stripe’s sales strategy and revenue outcomes across Enterprise, Mid-Market, and Startups, with a primary focus on Enterprise. Reporting to the India MD, you will build and lead a high-performing team of New Business Account Executives, establish the operating model for Stripe’s next phase of growth, and work directly with senior customers on their most important business challenges. You will also partner closely with Stripe’s regional and global leadership to shape our broader growth agenda for India.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We’re looking for a proactive leader who has demonstrated success operating in a high-growth environment, building and leading high-performing teams, and working through ambiguity with limited oversight. The ideal candidate has experience scaling a technology sales organization and brings strong business judgment, analytical ability, communication skills, and relationship-building skills.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Responsibilities&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Develop and execute Stripe’s sales and go-to-market strategy across Enterprise, Mid-Market, and Startups segment, with a primary focus on Enterprise and India’s AI-native and globally ambitious technology companies.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Build Stripe’s position across the India-US corridor, working with regional teams to help Indian businesses expand globally and global businesses grow in India.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Translate customer and market insights into clear priorities and input for Stripe’s product and solutions roadmap.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Recruit, develop, and lead a high-performing team of sales professionals.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Set the long-term vision for the India sales organization, establish a rigorous operating cadence, and drive predictable execution against key sales metrics.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Be accountable for revenue growth, new customer acquisition, and the expansion of Stripe’s business in India.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Coach the team in consultative and solution-based selling across every stage of the sales cycle.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Build and maintain enduring relationships with customers, including senior executives and C-level leaders.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Support the development and career growth of team members while increasing their impact at Stripe.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Work collaboratively across Sales, Product, Engineering, Marketing, Partnerships, and other teams to shape Stripe’s products and solutions around customer and market needs.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Represent Stripe at relevant industry events and build awareness of Stripe in the Indian market.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What success looks like&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;In your first 12 to 18 months, you will have established a clear growth strategy, strengthened and scaled the sales organization, deepened Stripe’s relationships with India’s leading companies, and built a more predictable, high-performing revenue engine.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Who you are&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You are a builder who has materially scaled a technology business, recruited and developed exceptional sales talent, and won the trust of sophisticated enterprise customers. You combine strategic ambition with operating discipline and are equally comfortable shaping a multi-year market strategy, coaching a team, and engaging a CEO on their most important growth priorities.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Minimum requirements&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;10+ years of sales experience, including 3+ years of people management experience.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience leading sales teams in a high-growth technology environment.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Demonstrated success selling to and building relationships with enterprise customers in India.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience developing and executing sales strategies across multiple customer segments.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ability to recruit, develop, coach, and retain a high-performing sales team.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong business judgment and the ability to make sound decisions in an ambiguous, fast-changing environment.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ability to build strategic relationships with senior executives, customers, partners, and industry leaders.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ability to understand and articulate technical concepts and translate them into relevant business outcomes.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Excellent written and verbal communication skills in English.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience working collaboratively across functions to deliver results.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Preferred qualifications&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience leading sales across Enterprise, Mid-Market, or Startups customer segments, with significant Enterprise experience.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience scaling a sales organization or business in India.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience in financial technology, payments, software, or another technology-led industry.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Demonstrated interest in startups, technology businesses, and the changing financial-services landscape in India.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;

&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Who we are &lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About Stripe&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Stripe is a financial infrastructure platform for businesses. Millions of companies—from the world’s largest enterprises to the most ambitious startups—use Stripe to accept payments, grow their revenue, and accelerate new business opportunities. Our mission is to increase the GDP of the internet, and we have a staggering amount of work ahead. That means you have an unprecedented opportunity to put the global economy within everyone’s reach while doing the most important work of your career.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About the team&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;The Startups Grower team is a highly consultative group that manages relationships, growth, and retention for Stripe’s largest and fastest-growing Funded Startup customers. As a manager on the team, you will oversee a group of Account Executives who have the opportunity to work with the entire suite of Stripe products. You will act as both a people manager and a strategic visionary for the team.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What you’ll do&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;As a Manager of the Core Grower team, you will help grow Stripe’s North American startup customers. You will build and lead a team of high-performing Account Executives, helping them develop their skills and deliver on ambitious targets while also working directly with customers.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Responsibilities&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Recruit and build a team of Existing Business sellers&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Work with senior leadership to develop the long-term vision and strategy for the team, and manage day-to-day operations with a focus on performance against key sales and growth metrics&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Be accountable for increasing upsell/cross-sell revenue and driving positive renewal outcomes among high-potential Startups&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Play a personal and direct role in building and maintaining enduring customer relationships, up to C-level&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Coach and guide the team in developing consultative and solution-based skills through all facets of the sales cycle for existing Stripe users&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Inspire, motivate and enable personal- and career-development of team members&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Work collaboratively and cross-functionally across the organization to help shape Stripe’s products and solutions to meet customer needs&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Partner with our VC and marketing teams to evolve our brand with Startups and align our GTM efforts&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Who you are&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We are looking for a proactive leader who has demonstrated success dealing with ambiguity, operating in a high-growth environment, managing high-performing teams, and solving problems with limited oversight. Ideal candidates will have experience scaling and managing a technology sales team, and possess first-class analytical, communication, and relationship-building skills. &amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We’re looking for someone who meets the minimum requirements to be considered for the role. If you meet these requirements, you are encouraged to apply. The preferred qualifications are a bonus—not a requirement.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Minimum requirements&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;8+ years of relevant experience, with at least 2 years in people management&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience leading sales or account management in an early stage, high-growth technology environment&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proven track record of high performance in a new business sales or existing customer upselling role&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ability to hire, train and coach a high-performance sales team&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ability to build relationships with strategic clients and industry thought leaders&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Demonstrated passion for start-ups and new technology businesses&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ability to understand and articulate technical concepts, and translate them into industry- or business-relevant terms&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Preferred qualifications&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Prior experience at a growth stage Internet/software company&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Prior experience in enterprise sales&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Prior experience in the payments industry&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;

