&lt;li&gt;Be accountable for driving product attach, increase share of wallet to deliver revenue at high rates of growth&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Work with senior leadership to develop the long-term vision and strategy for the team, and manage day-to-day operations with a focus on performance against key sales and growth metrics&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Coach and guide the team in developing consultative and solution-based sales skills&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Inspire, motivate and enable development of team members to promote career growth and impact for Stripe&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Work collaboratively and cross-functionally across the organization to implement programs that drive overall efficiency for the team&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Deeply understand the needs of mid market customers to shape Stripe’s products and solutions to meet their needs&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Play a personal and direct role in building and maintaining enduring customer relationships, up to C-level.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;Who you are&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We’re looking for someone who meets the minimum requirements to be considered for the role. If you meet these requirements, you are encouraged to apply. The preferred qualifications are a bonus, not a requirement. &amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;Minimum requirements&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;8+ years of relevant sales experience&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;3+ years of closing experience in mid-market or enterprise sales, OR 3+ years experience managing a closing team&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience forecasting and managing a high growth business&lt;/li&gt;
