&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;7+ years of experience in payments, fintech, financial services, or a related technology industry, including designing payment solutions or financial architectures for enterprise customers.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Deep knowledge of payment flows and payments architecture, including cards, wallets, local payment methods, multi-currency payments, payment orchestration, fraud and risk systems, money movement, and relevant ISO payment standards.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience advising large B2B and/or B2C enterprises on payment modernization, checkout optimisation, conversion and authorization improvement, cost optimisation, network compliance, or processing reliability.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong understanding of the APAC payments landscape and cross-border payment considerations&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong project management, documentation, and stakeholder communication skills, including the ability to work independently through ambiguity; professional fluency in English and Business Mandarin to conduct business and technical conversations with stakeholders across SEA, ANZ and Greater China&lt;/li&gt;
