&lt;p&gt;• Experience integrating Stripe or other RESTful APIs into web applications&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;• Experience with processor-agnostic fraud solutions and multi-processor payment environments&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;• Experience with risk management for various business models, such as platforms and marketplaces, subscription services, and digital goods and SaaS&lt;/p&gt;
