&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About the team&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://stripe.com/payments/link&quot;&gt;Link&lt;/a&gt; helps Stripe&#39;s merchants deliver frictionless and secure checkout experiences by auto-filling customers&#39; payment information, letting customers check out in seconds and pay in one click across the Link merchant network.&amp;nbsp;The Link Bank Connections team is responsible for the connectivity layer to financial institutions that enables Financial Connections to offer users seamless, reliable, and performant access to financial data.&lt;/p&gt;
