&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Working with teams across the organization to understand pain points in their infrastructure usage to find common ideas and work to create solutions which span multiple domains;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Define and produce high quality written proposals, communications and documentation.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Execute on technical programs that require deep systems and engineering level knowledge;&lt;/li&gt;
