&lt;li&gt;Develop, implement, and iterate on program management techniques, frameworks, and KPIs to achieve goals with well defined success criteria;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Elevate the execution muscle of engineering teams around you;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Train them to be better at delivery where needed;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Help influence peers / stakeholders and build consensus while dealing with ambiguity;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Leverage data and acquired knowledge to drive strategic decisions at an engineering leadership level;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Create widely circulated plans, driving consistency, clarity and building alignment across teams;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Operationalize and execute critical cross functional programs spanning multiple engineering organizations for Infrastructure (Developer Infrastructure, Core Infrastructure, Service Infrastructure);&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Shape technical design, predicting technical roadblocks by collaborating with engineers, and identify trade-offs;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Drive programs that span across Stripe in the core infrastructure of Stripe’s payment systems;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Responsible for the successful definition, cross-functional strategy, planning and execution of large-scale technical programs.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Solve complex problems and enable products and infrastructure at scale;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Deliver exceptional results through building and implementing solutions that scale while protecting our users and serving the business; and&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Demonstrate deep technical expertise in software infrastructure (e.g. AWS Cloud Infrastructure, Microsoft Azure, Google Cloud, Oracle Cloud, etc.)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Who you are&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Minimum requirements&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Must have a Bachelor&#39;s degree or foreign equivalent in Engineering, Computer Science, Management Information Systems, or a related field, plus 5 years of progressive, postbaccalaureate experience in Software engineering, systems engineering or technical program management.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;4 years experience in Core infrastructure including database, cloud compute, networking and services;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;4 years experience in Program management during all phases of software development from kick-off to launch;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;2 years experience in Service Oriented Architecture (SOA);&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;5 years experience in software architecture and systems design;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;5 years experience in technical program management in software infrastructure;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;5 years experience in cloud infrastructure in compute, networking, databases, or service frameworks; and&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;1 year experience in SQL.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
